The  utility retrieves the user information from the system.  The
utility is only available if built with See for more information.
The following command line option is recognised: Return 0 if  the
user exists, and non‐zero if the user does not exist, on the sys‐
tem.   No  information is displayed.  This form of the command is
useful for scripts which need to check whether a particular  user
name  or  uid  is already in use on the system.  The argument may
